            <p class="plan-hero__lead">I’m Carl Ball, the developer behind Code Craft North. I combine around 15 years of web experience with a small, personal service for businesses that want clear advice and a website built properly.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-8">
                <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary btn-shine justify-center">Start a conversation</a>
